guide completionist-horde/event-hallows-end
title Hallow's End
faction Horde
category Miscellaneous
folder Completionist events and extras
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
pitch The quests of Hallow's End, as far as the reference data places them.

step About this guide
  note Each quest here is offered only while the event runs. Every step is optional: do what the calendar offers now, and come back for the rest.

# Written in: quests the drafter could not route. Each is taken once what it follows is handed in.

