step Hallow's End Treats for Spoops!
  zone map 1454
  accept 8312 optional

step Hallow's End Treats for Spoops!
  tip Thunder Bluff Marzipan: take Dancing for Marzipan from Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff, target her and type /dance.
  tip Undercity Mint: take Chicken Clucking for a Mint from Innkeeper Norman in the Undercity, target him and type /chicken.
  tip Orgrimmar Nougat: take Flexing for Nougat from Innkeeper Gryshka in Orgrimmar, target her and type /flex.
  tip Darkspear Gumdrop: take Incoming Gumdrop from Kali Remik in Sen'jin Village, target Kali Remik and type /train.
  when onquest 8312
  tip The reference data does not place this quest's objective: follow the quest text.
  zone map 1454
  complete 8312 @71.4,22.8 optional

